  "body": "Viewing by private appointment only - Call now to book.\r\n\r\nIn the heart of beautiful Murrays Bay, this home sits on an elevated, private, 675m² freehold section, tucked away off the road. Offering a substantial floor area of approximately 300m², the residence is perfectly positioned right in the zone for North Shore’s most prestigious schools. The location offers the ultimate convenience for families, situated just a short walk from Rangitoto College, Murrays Bay Intermediate, and Murrays Bay Primary.\r\n\r\nMeticulously maintained by its current owner of twenty-five years, this home has been a cherished family sanctuary where you can truly feel the warmth and care within its walls. The second floor is dedicated to rest and retreat, featuring four good-sized bedrooms and a separate study. The master suite serves as a private getaway, complete with its own ensuite, a walk-in wardrobe, and a balcony where you can sit and enjoy the sparkling sea views with your morning cuppa; a view also shared by the third bedroom.\r\n\r\nThe north-facing aspect ensures the entire home is bright, sunny, and welcoming throughout the day. The ground floor is designed for effortless family life, offering two expansive living areas and a large kitchen that ensures everyone has their own space to breathe. These living areas open seamlessly onto a private deck, a paved patio, and a beautifully planted garden, creating an idyllic setting for summer evenings and outdoor entertaining.\r\n\r\nPracticality is woven into every corner of the lower level, which includes a separate laundry and a separate guest toilet to keep the household running smoothly. A double internal access garage provides security and ease of entry, rounding out a home that perfectly balances significant scale with the relaxed, coastal charm of Murrays Bay.\r\n\r\nParking is never a problem. Between your own driveway and a one-sixth share of a private, off-street driveway, there is plenty of room for the whole family and guests. It makes coming and going a breeze.\r\n\r\nYour new 'Bays' lifestyle starts here! Walk the beautiful coastal path to Browns Bay or Mairangi Bay. Enjoy the best local cafes, restaurants, and boutique shopping. You truly will never look back.\r\n\r\nConjunctionals from all agents welcomed!",
